Folks,  I would like to get involved in the ongoing work on HDP.

In reading the threads, it appears there are two parts to the
implementation.

Sancane and others at OpenHealth are in the process of building
their HDP/MCAP code so that it runs as a plugin in Bluez.

Gustavo is completing work on eL2CAP which needs to be rolled into
the kernel.

As I understand, finishing up both of these efforts is necessary in order
to have a compliant HDP implementation.

If this is an isn't quite right, or there are other parts of the project, 
please comment.

Any recommendations on the best manner to get involved would be 
appreciated.

